+// A13: the profile's last window closed, and then a window of the profile
+// opened that does not bring it back, as the Mac's Dock and menu bar open
+// one, or any window that starts no session restore. The session commits the
+// close: the window's tabs are closed tabs, rows now and after the relaunch,
